<Slide style={{
    background: '#F7FAF6',
    paddingTop: 20, paddingBottom: 20, paddingLeft: 72, paddingRight: 72,
}}>
    <Box style={{ height: 100, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32' }}>不会问，就照着问</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#1F7A5C', marginTop: 8 }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 528, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 660, gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 121, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 18, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(30,58,50,0.08)' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F7A5C' }}>了解产品</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 10, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>这个产品主要是做什么的？</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>它适合什么人？</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>和另一款比区别在哪？</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 121, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 18, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(30,58,50,0.08)' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F7A5C' }}>使用答疑</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 10, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>这个产品怎么使用？</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>使用时要注意什么？</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>我这种情况重点注意什么？</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 121, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 18, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(30,58,50,0.08)' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F7A5C' }}>案例参考</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 10, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>有没有和我情况差不多的案例？</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>哪类案例更适合我参考？</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(31,122,92,0.08)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>最值得参考的是哪一点？</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 121, background: 'rgba(224,138,60,0.14)', borderRadius: 14, padding: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C9742B' }}>继续追问</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 10, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>请你说得简单一点</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>请你分点告诉我</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 10 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1E3A32' }}>你刚才的重点是什么？</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F7A5C', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                背不下来就照抄，<br />抄几次就成自己的了
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#6B7C75', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 20 }}>
                这四组模板覆盖了日常八成以上的场景。第一次照着打，第二次改两个词，第三次你会发现——自己写出来的问句，已经自然带上了必要的背景信息。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#6B7C75', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 16 }}>
                同一句模板换个产品名就能反复用，比如把"这个产品"换成具体名字，答案的准确度会立刻不一样。
            </Text>

            <Box style={{
                marginTop: 'auto', background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 18,
                boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(30,58,50,0.08)',
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A32', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    把问题里的"这个产品"<br />换成具体名字
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#6B7C75', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    这是提升回答质量最快的一招，成本只有三个字。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M12 21C12 21 4 17 4 10C4 6 7 3 12 3C17 3 20 6 20 10C20 17 12 21 12 21Z" fill="#1F7A5C" opacity="0.75" />
                <path d="M12 21V6" stroke="#FFFFFF" strokeWidth="1.6" fill="none" />
            </svg>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7C75' }}>AI宝儿 · 五期上手课</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7C75' }}>13 / 33</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
